<title>CANADA: SR Telecom gets C$86 mln Thailand order.</title>
<headline>SR Telecom gets C$86 mln Thailand order.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SR Telecom Inc said on Monday it signed a contract for a second expansion order worth about C$86 million with Rural Telephone Services Co of Thailand to supply products to the national Telephone Organization of Thailand.</p>
<p>SR said it was the largest single order it had received so far. When the order is added to previous orders, the project totals C$167 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Deliveries are expected to start in the last quarter of 1996 and will continue for about two years,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
